From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dinesh Choudhary <idinesh@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:11:21 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] fix(qti): configure Shikra PS_HOLD

Use the Shikra v5.1 offsets for both PS_HOLD reset-control registers:
0x85A and 0x85B.

Assisted-by: GPT-5.6
Change-Id: I3b7298381d161e8f523df7b949d2419244b9995a
Link: https://review.trustedfirmware.org/c/56747
Signed-off-by: Dinesh Choudhary <idinesh@qti.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/qualcomm-linux/trusted-firmware-a/commit/e60744d954335abb8f23bd8ea2cf7027ea472596]
Signed-off-by: Roshan Sivakumar <roshs@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 plat/qti/bruin/shikra/inc/shikra_def.h | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/plat/qti/bruin/shikra/inc/shikra_def.h b/plat/qti/bruin/shikra/inc/shikra_def.h
index 948ad3225..3c97e6d07 100644
--- a/plat/qti/bruin/shikra/inc/shikra_def.h
+++ b/plat/qti/bruin/shikra/inc/shikra_def.h
@@ -185,8 +185,8 @@
 /*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
 /* LC PON register offsets */
 /*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
-#define PON_PS_HOLD_RESET_CTL			0x852
-#define PON_PS_HOLD_RESET_CTL2			0x853
+#define PON_PS_HOLD_RESET_CTL			0x85A
+#define PON_PS_HOLD_RESET_CTL2			0x85B
 /*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
 /* APSS HM registers */
 /*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
